	(text "RF test board for the TI SWRA117D 2.45 GHz printed inverted-F antenna.\n\nJ1 feeds a 1.5 mm wide 50 ohm microstrip on 0.8 mm FR4 (er 4.4, tan d 0.02).\nC1 / L1 / C2 form a pi matching network; only L1 is fitted by default.\nAE1 pin 2 must sit on the ground plane edge - see the keep-out on the PCB.\n\nSimulation: sim/s11_pi_match.cir (ngspice, lumped antenna model) and\nsim/openems/swra117d_openems.py (full wave S11, impedance, far field)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 112 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "7dfd23af-dc26-5f60-af27-9ae71eddfd7c")
	)
